  patches/sparse-tier-spill-kvcheck.patch,
  patches/sparse-prefill-yield-bypass.patch and
  patches/sparse-gdn-recover.patch modify vLLM 0.31 files (the last also
  adds model_executor/layers/mamba/gdn/recover.py, a new file by this
  project). patches/sparse-parser-qwen3-backports.patch,
  patches/sparse-frontend-backports.patch and
