  #65775, #63668; #64141, the last as carried in HyperQwen #404),
  written by their respective vLLM contributors
  and adapted here; they contain vLLM code. sparsekv/sched.py subclasses
  vLLM's Scheduler and AsyncScheduler at run time. Result
  files under run*/ contain vLLM source excerpts quoted in model outputs
  (Apache-2.0; some vllm_flash_attn excerpts derive from
  Dao-AILab/flash-attention, https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention,
  BSD-3-Clause).

