  sparsekv/patches/pthfa-sparse-kv.patch modifies its vllm_backend.py.
  pthfa/python/pth_flash_attn/sparse_kv.py and fa2_prefill.py are new files
  by this project. The pthfa sources under pthfa/csrc/ that
  patches/hyperqwen-base.diff modifies (flat GQA rows, off by default) are
